{"server":"en","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-08_beg","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-08","title":"Acute Stress Disorder","storyCode":"4-8","avgTag":"Before Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"1cc9528a93d9b158a0185382385330a6808218a0811f1e4dacd6897cf7e88a50","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmm...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Where is this..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We're getting close to the coordinates that Frostleaf sent us, but..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"What a disgusting smell."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"It's the stench of something burning...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Where did Reunion lead us to?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Tsk! Watch out for the sneak attack!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Darn it...!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Caster","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"I... I missed?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't worry. We're safe here!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Caster","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"Guh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Wh-what's wrong?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Caster","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"Guh... urgh... aah..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"He won't be able to answer you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Wh-what?!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"From that building!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Wait, is that..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Frostleaf! Frostleaf, is that you"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"It is. I've taken care of the enemy."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Sorry for making you worry, Amiya."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you injured?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Medic, hurry!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"No way... Why is your body all frostbitten? What happened to you..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't worry, it's minor."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Meteorite and Jessica are still in the main square."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"They should be safe for the time being, but it's hard to say how long that's going to last for."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"I managed to lure the enemy out, so Reunion hasn't found them yet."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"The enemy?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Our cover hasn't been blown yet, so there's no need for concern yet."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"But, he's going to come soon..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Where are you hiding, little fox?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Hurry and come out. Our game of hide and seek is about to come to an end."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"For every minute you stay hidden, I'll break another one of your friends' fingers--"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Do you still plan to keep running?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"(Mephisto...!)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"(He's bluffing. Don't take the bait.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"(What is he doing...)"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Reunion is moving."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"That little...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We have to get in touch with Meteorite..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Huh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Why can't I get through? We've clearly already crossed the contaminated area..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"*sigh*..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Take a look at this."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Your communicator?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"It's... frozen over? Did it get... ruined by the frost?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Mephisto is a nobody."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"There's something wandering in this city..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"...that is far more terrifying."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Something more terrifying?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"The Yetis. If we run into them, we'll be in serious trouble."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Yetis? Are you talking about the Yeti Squadron? What are they exactly...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't have time to explain right now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"But they are the ones... behind the sudden temperature drop, as well as our squads' injuries."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"It seems like this squad has already established their territory within this city."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"The sky is getting darker. This is a good opportunity for us..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We'll be able to cross this open area more easily."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's go rescue Meteorite and Jessica first."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll lead the way."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"What are those things in the main square? I can't really see..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Are they... statues of some sort? Their shapes are really strange..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"And this smell makes me want to vomit..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Over here. Don't get separated."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't go look at those things..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"--We have company."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's take them out before they notice us."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["Reunion Member"]},{"speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","aliases":["Reunion Caster"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["Mephisto"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["???","Frostleaf"]}]}
